  "id": "eft",
  "term": "EFT",
  "definition": "EFT, or Emotional Freedom Techniques, is an energy psychology approach that combines acupoint tapping with cognitive, bodily, and exposure-based elements. In the research literature, Clinical EFT usually means a standardized, manualized form that uses set procedures and therapist-guided, trauma-informed regulation rather than informal self-help tapping.",
